[
  {
    "content_id": "10054001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保罗奉我们救主上帝和赐我们盼望的基督耶稣的命令，做基督耶稣的使徒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;写信给因信主而做我真儿子的提摩太。 愿父上帝和我们的主基督耶稣赐给你恩典、怜悯和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我去马其顿的时候，曾经劝你继续留在以弗所，好命令那几个人不要传讲异端邪说，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;也不要沉迷于无稽之谈和冗长的家谱，因为这些事只会引起争论，无法帮助人凭信心认识上帝的计划。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;这命令的目的是为了爱，这爱来自于清洁的心、无愧的良心和真实无伪的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;可惜有些人却偏离这些，转向空洞的谈论。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他们想做律法教师，却不明白自己所谈论所主张的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我们知道，只要用得合宜，律法本是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因为律法并不是为义人设的，而是为了对付那些目无法纪、大逆不道、不敬畏上帝、犯罪作恶、不圣洁、贪恋世俗、杀害父母、行凶害命、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;淫乱、同性恋、拐卖人口、说谎、起假誓的人，以及其他违反正道的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;这正道来自当受称颂的上帝托付我传扬的荣耀福音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我感谢赐我力量的主基督耶稣，因为祂视我忠心可靠，派我事奉祂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;尽管我从前是个亵渎上帝、迫害和侮辱信徒的人，但我仍然蒙了怜悯，因为那时我无知，还没有信耶稣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我们的主赐给我丰富的恩典，使我在基督耶稣里有信心和爱心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;这句话千真万确、完全可信：“基督耶稣降世，为要拯救罪人。”在罪人中我是个罪魁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;但我依然蒙了怜悯，因为基督耶稣要在我这个罪魁身上彰显祂无限的忍耐，使我做那些要信靠祂并得永生之人的榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;愿尊贵、荣耀归给那位不朽的、肉眼不能见的万世君王——独一无二的上帝，直到永远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我儿提摩太啊，我依照从前有关你的预言，把这命令托付给你，好使你借此打美好的仗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你要持守信心和无愧的良心。有些人丧掉良心，结果他们的信仰就像船触了礁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;其中有许米乃和亚历山大。我已经把他们交给撒旦，使他们学到教训，不再说亵渎的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我劝你首先要为所有的人恳求、祷告、代求和感谢上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;也要为所有的君王和掌权者祷告，使我们可以怀着虔诚、端正的心过和平安宁的生活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;这样做很美好，是蒙我们的救主上帝悦纳的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因为祂愿世人都得救，明白真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;上帝只有一位，在上帝和世人之间只有一位中保，就是降世为人的基督耶稣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂舍命作所有人的赎价，这在所定的时候已显明出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;为此，我被指派做传道人和使徒，教导外族人认识信仰和真理。我说的是实话，并非谎言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我愿男人举起圣洁的手随处祷告，不发怒，不争辩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我愿女人衣着得体，朴素端庄，不靠发型、珠宝金饰或名贵衣服来妆饰自己，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;要有善行，这样才配称为敬畏上帝的女人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;女人应当安安静静地学习，完全顺服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我不准女人教导或管辖男人，她们应当保持安静。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因为先造的是亚当，后造的是夏娃，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;并非亚当受骗，而是夏娃受骗陷入罪中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;不过，女人如果持守信心和爱心，圣洁自律，就必在生育的事上得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;“人若渴望做教会的监督，就是在爱慕尊贵的工作。”这句话千真万确。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;做监督的人必须无可指责，只有一位妻子，为人节制自律、受人尊敬、乐于接待客旅、善于教导、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;待人温和，不酗酒、不好斗、不争吵、不贪财，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;善于管理自己的家，受儿女的敬重和孝顺。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;一个人要是不懂得管理自己的家，又怎能照顾上帝的教会呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;初信主的人不可做监督，免得他自高自大，遭受魔鬼所受的惩罚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;做监督的在教会以外也必须有好名声，以免被人指责，陷入魔鬼的圈套。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;同样，做执事的也要品行端正，说话诚实，不好酒，不贪财，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要存着清洁的良心持守奥妙的真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他们要先接受考验，倘若无可指责，就可以立他们为执事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;执事的妻子也要品行端正，不搬弄是非，为人节制，做事忠心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;执事只能有一位妻子，他要管好自己的儿女和自己的家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;尽忠职守的执事能得到好声誉，也会对基督耶稣有坚定的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我希望能尽快去你那里，但还是先写信告诉你这些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;这样，如果我行期延误，你也可以知道在上帝的家中该怎么做。这家是永活上帝的教会，是真理的柱石和根基。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;毫无疑问，我们伟大的信仰奥妙无比： 祂以肉身显现， 被圣灵证明为义， 被天使看见， 被传扬到列邦， 被世人信奉， 被接到天上的荣耀中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;圣灵明确地说，日后必有人离弃真道，去追随那些迷惑人的邪灵和鬼魔的学说。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;这些学说是出自假冒伪善的骗子，他们良心丧尽，麻木不仁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;禁止人结婚和吃某些食物。其实那些食物是上帝创造的，为了让相信并且明白真理的人存感恩的心领受。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;上帝所造的一切都是美好的，若以感恩的心去领受，就无需任何禁忌，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;因为上帝的道和人的祷告可以使食物圣洁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你若提醒弟兄姊妹这些事，就是基督耶稣的好仆人，在信仰之道和你所遵行的美善教导上得到了造就。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;但你要弃绝世俗、荒诞的传说，要训练自己做敬虔的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;锻炼身体益处还少，敬虔生活万事受益，拥有今生和永世的应许。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;这话真实可信，值得完全接受。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我们劳苦奋斗正是为此，因为我们的盼望在于永活的上帝。祂是天下人的救主，更是信徒的救主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你要吩咐和教导这些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不要因为年轻而叫人小看你，总要在言语、行为、爱心、信心和纯洁各方面做信徒的榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;在我来之前，你要专心宣读圣经，勉励会众，教导真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;不要忽略你的恩赐，那是借着预言在众长老把手按在你身上时赐给你的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你要全心全意做这些事，让大家都看到你的长进。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你要注意自己的言行和教导，并持之以恒。这样，你不但能救自己，也能救那些听你教导的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;不要斥责年长的，要像对待父亲一样劝他们；对待青年男子要情同手足；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;对待年长的妇女要情同母亲；对待青年女子要心思纯正，视她们如姊妹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;要敬重和帮助那些真正有需要的寡妇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;寡妇如果有儿孙，就要叫她们的儿孙在家中学习尽孝道，奉养她们，以报答养育之恩，这是上帝所悦纳的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;真正有需要、无依无靠的寡妇仰赖上帝的帮助，昼夜不住地祷告祈求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;但贪图享乐的寡妇虽然活着，却已经死了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你当教导众人这些事，好叫他们无可指责。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;谁不照顾自己的亲属，尤其是不照顾自己的家人，就是背弃信仰，比不信的人还坏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;列入名册的寡妇必须年满六十岁，在婚姻上从一而终，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;并且在善事上有好名声，如教养儿女、接待外人、服侍圣徒、救助困苦、竭力做各种善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;不要把年轻的寡妇列入名册，因为当她们情欲冲动、无法持守对基督的委身时，就想再嫁，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;以致违背了起初的誓言而受审判。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;况且，她们不仅懒散成性，四处串门，还说长道短，好管闲事，搬弄是非。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所以，我建议年轻的寡妇再嫁，生儿育女，料理家务，不要给仇敌毁谤的机会，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;因为有些人已经偏离正道，去追随撒旦了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;女信徒的家里若有寡妇，就应该自己照顾她们，免得加重教会的负担，这样教会才能照顾那些真正无依无靠的寡妇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;那些善于管理教会的长老，尤其是那些辛勤传道和教导人的，理当得到加倍的敬养。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;因为圣经上说：“牛在踩谷时，不可笼住它的嘴。”又说：“工人理应得到工钱。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;若有人向你控告长老，必须有两三个证人，否则不要受理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;那些一直犯罪的人，你要当众责备他们，以警戒众人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我在上帝和基督耶稣及蒙拣选的众天使面前吩咐你：要遵行这些话，不要有成见，不要偏心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;为人行按手礼，不要操之过急。不要沾染别人的罪，要洁身自好。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;你的胃不好，经常生病，不要只喝水，要稍微喝一点酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;有些人的罪很明显，自招审判，有些人的罪日后才暴露出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054005025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 5:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54005025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;同样，有些善行很明显，不明显的也不会被长久埋没。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;做奴仆的要全心尊重自己的主人，免得上帝的名和我们的教导被人亵渎。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;如果主人是基督徒，做奴仆的不可因为同是信徒就不尊敬自己的主人，反而要更好地服侍他，因为这些接受服侍的人是蒙爱的信徒。你要教导和强调这些事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;如果有人传其他教义，不符合我们主耶稣基督纯正的道和敬虔的教导，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他就是狂妄自大、一无所知。这种人专好问难，争辩字句，结果引起嫉妒、纷争、毁谤和猜忌，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;使那些思想败坏、失去真理的人争论不休，把敬虔当作生财之道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;其实敬虔和知足才是真财富，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为我们空手来到世上，也要空手离开。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;只要有吃有穿，就该知足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;那些渴望发财的人却陷入诱惑、网罗和许多愚蠢有害的欲望中，以致陷入败坏和灭亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;贪财是万恶之根，有人因为贪财就离弃了信仰，结果饱尝各种锥心之痛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;但你这属上帝的人要远避这些事，要追求公义、敬虔、信心、爱心、忍耐和温柔，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;要为真道打美好的仗，并持定永生。你是为永生蒙召的，并在许多见证人面前做过美好的见证。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;在赐万物生命的上帝面前，也在向本丢·彼拉多做过美好见证的基督耶稣面前，我嘱咐你：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;要遵守这命令，做纯洁无瑕、无可指责的人，一直到我们的主耶稣基督再来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;到了时候，配得称颂、独有权能的万王之王、万主之主要使基督显现。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;上帝是独一不朽的，住在人不能接近的光中，从来没有人见过祂，也没有人能够看见祂。愿尊贵和永远的权柄都归给祂。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你要劝诫那些今世富足的人不要高傲，也不要冀望于靠不住的钱财，要信靠将万物厚赐给我们享用的上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你要劝他们行善，广积善行，慷慨施舍，乐意助人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他们这样做是为自己积攒财宝，为将来奠定美好的根基，好持守真正的生命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;提摩太啊，你要持守所托付给你的，避开世俗的空谈和那些违背真理、似是而非的学问。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10054006021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太前书 6:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "54006021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;有些自称有这种学问的人已经偏离了信仰。 愿恩典与你们同在！</p>"
  }
]